# Project guidelines
This is test project dashboard that show case use of microservice architecture.

## Other
- Before and after any tool use, give me a confidence level (0-10) on how confident you are in this solution.
- Before writing code:
  1. Analyze all code files thoroughly
  2. Get full context
  3. Write .MD implementation plan
  4. Then implement code
- Check project files before suggesting structural or dependency changes